  storyText: "Three Doors\n\nYou stop somewhere dark to think. Three paths:\n\nThe Voodoo Boys in Pacifica - netrunners who want to reach beyond the Blackwall. Arasaka - rich, powerful, very interested. The Aldecaldos nomads in the Badlands - who don't care about corps at all.\n\n1. Pacifica - the Voodoo Boys.\n2. Arasaka.\n3. The Badlands - the Aldecaldos."
